      ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\displaystyle \\int 6e^x  \\textrm d x.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Factoring out the constant $6$ and taking the integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\\int 6e^x   \\textrm d x   =6 \\int e^x  \\, \\textrm d x =6e^x +C.\n                                                                               \n}\n$$"
